s is not a P3P policy! See g.co/p3phelp for more info.\\\"', \\r\\n'Content-Encoding': 'gzip', 'Server': 'gws', 'X-XSS-Protection': '0', \\r\\n'X-Frame-Options': 'SAMEORIGIN', 'Set-Cookie': 'SOCS=CAAaBgiAmJWnBg; expires=Sat, \\r\\n21-Sep-2024 16:08:49 GMT; path=/; domain=.google.com; Secure; SameSite=lax, \\r\\nAEC=Ad49MVFl3w4DY94CQi-gf_PVObGt9elybIiZtxypp0YtY72ry6fqk7BabQ; expires=Mon, \\r\\n19-Feb-2024 16:08:49 GMT; path=/; domain=.google.com; Secure; HttpOnly; SameSite=lax, \\r\\n__Secure-ENID=14.SE=KWbL5XujSea1jqO5SxWtrQ8ehy_TqnwI3oYhaXpykAA_RoguQQvQTvsrorgGd-A5_h\\r\\nrdqgz4KknqtKyo_9kMFrTmtKY0BMw9tCcPYRAVc9B9dyp8rafr_Wh4KmqpIY3Y0eVuTNxUGi7gaMUv_LZfvmgL\\r\\neJacYTmmz80cb4_d-Cc; expires=Sun, 22-Sep-2024 08:27:07 GMT; path=/; \\r\\ndomain=.google.com; Secure; HttpOnly; SameSite=lax', 'Alt-Svc': 'h3=\\\":443\\\"; \\r\\nma=2592000,h3-29=\\\":443\\\"; ma=2592000', 'Transfer-Encoding': 'chunked'}\\r\\n```\"}\n{\"number\": 4029, \"title\": \"Request: Enable PRs from forks for contributors\", \"created_at\": \"2026-03-05T12:18:04Z\", \"closed_at\": \"2026-03-06T02:44:25Z\", \"state_reason\": \"completed\", \"body\": \"Hi Rich maintainers,\\\\n\\\\nI have a fix ready for mixed-width text handling in , but I currently can’t open a PR to the upstream repository from my fork.\\\\n\\\\nPR with the fix:\\\\nhttps://github.com/Siew-s-Capital/rich/pull/1\\\\n\\\\nCould you please either:\\\\n1) grant me collaborator access, **or**\\\\n2) enable PRs from forks for contributors\\\\n\\\\nso I can submit this change properly?\\\\n\\\\nThanks for your time and for maintaining Rich.\"}\n{\"number\": 4123, \"title\": \"[BUG] README contains unreachable external link (\\\"See what people are saying about Rich\\\")\", \"created_at\": \"2026-05-14T21:17:58Z\", \"closed_at\": null, \"state_reason\": null, \"body\": \"Hello,\\n\\nI noticed that the GitHub README contains an external link under:\\n\\n> \\\"See what people are saying about Rich\\\"\\n\\nwhich points to:\\n\\n> `https://www.willmcgugan.com/blog/pages/post/rich-tweets/`\\n\\nThis link appears to be unreachable.\\n\\nI tested:\\n- Firefox\\n- Chrome\\n- `curl` from command line\\n- across multiple days\\n- without VPN\\n\\nand consistently received connection failures / timeouts.\\n\\nSince users following the README may encounter this unreachable resource, I wanted to report it. If helpful, I'd be happy to submit a PR to remove or update the link.\\n\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
